  N'Migrate the on premises SQL Server estate and the legacy SSIS packages into a lakehouse architecture. Three phases: assessment, pilot migration of the customer master domain, then the remaining nine domains. Success is measured on query latency at the reporting layer and on decommissioning the two oldest servers before the data centre lease expires.',
