 (5002, 101, N'Priya Raman', N'priya.raman@consultco.com', '2026-08-04', 6.00, 1, N'Delivery',
  N'Built the silver layer transformations for customer master, including the deduplication rule the business agreed in July. Raised a question with Rachel about how to treat historically merged accounts.',
  DATEADD(HOUR, -2, SYSUTCDATETIME()), 0),
 (5003, 101, N'Jonas Berg', N'jonas.berg@consultco.com', '2026-08-04', 8.00, 1, N'Delivery',
  N'Rewrote four SSIS packages as pipeline activities. The lookup transformations were the slow part; two of them were doing row by row calls against a remote server.',
  DATEADD(HOUR, -3, SYSUTCDATETIME()), 0),
 (5004, 101, N'Priya Raman', N'priya.raman@consultco.com', '2026-08-05', 3.50, 1, N'Advisory',
  N'Working session with the Contoso data governance group on ownership of the migrated domains. Agreed that domain owners sign off the silver layer, not the platform team.',
  DATEADD(HOUR, -4, SYSUTCDATETIME()), 0),
 (5005, 101, N'Jonas Berg', N'jonas.berg@consultco.com', '2026-08-06', 7.00, 1, N'Delivery',
  N'Query latency testing at the reporting layer. Median improved from 4.2 seconds to under 900 milliseconds, but the ninety fifth percentile is still poor on the two largest fact tables.',
  DATEADD(HOUR, -5, SYSUTCDATETIME()), 0),
 (5006, 101, N'Yuki Tanaka', N'yuki.tanaka@consultco.com', '2026-08-07', 5.50, 1, N'Testing',
